#{
	#-README{
		LOOK HERE!

		Notice the abasense of this text
		in the preview panel.

		Edit this and watch the Tree, Graph
		and Preview change.

		Read the comments in the renderer panel
		to activate and deactivate various features.

		They are marked with `// F:`.

		The skeleton is just this code.
		Rest of it is features.

		```
		function WALK(node) {
			if (node instanceof Blob) {
				return ...;
			}

			if (node instanceof Code) {
				return ...;
			}

			if (node instanceof Bag) {
				...
				for (const k of node.kids) {
					... = WALK(k);
				}
				...
			}
		}
		```
	}

	Here is #b{bold}, #i{itallic}, #u{underline}.

	Here is some inline code `let x = 233;`.

	Multiline code snippet:
	```
	def foo():
		return bar()
	```.

